  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo></math> Sum of frequencies&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>584</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>110</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>54</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>584</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>390</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Now, Median is at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>584</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>292</mn><mi>th</mi></msup></math>&nbsp;term</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo></math> Median <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>45</mn></math>&nbsp;(lies in class <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>40</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>50</mn></math>)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>110</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>54</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>292</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>113</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>On solving, equations&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>113</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>390</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>113</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>277</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>|</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>164</mn></math></p>",
